WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:05.922
This is arguably the most
popular place to come

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.590
if you want your hair back.

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.344
Istanbul's hair transplant industry's

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.097
worth north of a billion U.S. dollars

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:17.600
and before COVID, it's
estimated half a million people

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.478
came here in the hope
of regaining their hair.

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:24.649
But, it's a lightly regulated industry.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:28.153
No one knows exactly how
many clinics are out there,

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:30.697
or how many operations take place.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.574
Sadly, I have no idea.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.452
And I've been looking at
this for over a decade.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:36.995
It is a data black hole.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:40.248
I need a calculator to tell
you a number, actually.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:44.085
We are assuming about 1,500

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:49.090
2,000 operations are made,
daily basis in Turkey.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.677
The industry has exploded in size

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.304
over the last decade,

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:56.931
attracting patients from across the world.

00:00:56.931 --> 00:01:00.560
In this situation you really need a lot of attention

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.604
But, as more men pack their bags

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:05.482
and fly to Turkey, are medical standards

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:08.359
being dropped in favor of profit?

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.445
Hair transplant surgery, in many ways,

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.821
has become a market.

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:14.991
So people see hair transplant
surgery as a commodity.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:17.410
The business of hair transplantation

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.288
has been very much
designed on bums on seats

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:22.624
and telling people what they want to hear.

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:25.710
And sadly, this is surgery,

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.755
and in the wrong hands
it can be devastating.

00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:41.851
Hello.

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:44.062
Hello, my friend.

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:45.188
You're making a video?

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:48.608
Hussain Hazime and Saad Nemer Saad

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:51.069
have traveled from the USA to Istanbul

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:53.196
to radically change the way they look.

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:57.117
How do you feel?
Good, good.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.576
They're here at Blue Magic,

00:01:58.576 --> 00:02:01.788
a premium hair treatment
clinic in Istanbul.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.958
I started losing my hair
about five years ago.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:09.170
It was very upsetting, when
it started to shed, basically.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:13.049
And this is like everyday in
the morning, when you wash up,

00:02:13.049 --> 00:02:14.884
you see more hair in the sink.

00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:16.678
And you're thinking to
yourself like, what's going on?

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:17.887
What can I do different?

00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:22.559
Hussain's 55, from Detroit, Michigan.

00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:25.645
His friend's from Scottsdale, Arizona.

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.772
Yeah, most of them, they seem to be black.

00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:30.775
They discovered Blue Magic online.

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:33.528
And I actually looked away from your site

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:35.905
to other people that did their own videos.

00:02:35.905 --> 00:02:37.448
So that gave me a good feeling about it.

00:02:37.448 --> 00:02:39.075
They said that they
got a lot of attention,

00:02:39.075 --> 00:02:41.661
that gave me a good feeling about it.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:42.829
So what we do, actually,

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:46.791
we extract from this one,
because it's good hair.

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:48.668
Like most patients in Istanbul,

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.628
Hussain and Saad have
undergone a procedure

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:53.882
called follicular unit excision, or FUE.

00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:55.925
This is where clumps of hair follicles

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:59.053
are removed from the sides
and back of your head,

00:02:59.053 --> 00:03:03.266
and implanted into the areas
where the hair loss is.

00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:04.934
It takes about four to five hours.

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:07.520
And if it's done correctly,
it looks natural.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.231
Having my hair back will
probably make me feel

00:03:10.231 --> 00:03:12.817
better than I have in a long time.

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:15.236
It's been a long time
since I felt this way.

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:16.779
Just having it would be great.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:21.075
With their luxury offices and clinics,

00:03:21.075 --> 00:03:24.329
Blue Magic are at the
expensive end of the spectrum.

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:27.207
But even with the hotel
and translator included,

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.958
clients can expect to spend around

00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:32.795
4,000 to 5,000 U.S. dollars
for the treatment.

00:03:32.795 --> 00:03:34.505
That's typically half the price

00:03:34.505 --> 00:03:37.550
you pay in the U.S., U.K., or EU.

00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:40.220
You look like a buckethead.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.763
Hussain and Saad are heading

00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:44.265
back to The States happy customers,

00:03:44.265 --> 00:03:47.018
hoping that their days of
hat wearing are behind them.

00:03:47.018 --> 00:03:48.645
Thanks guys.
Thank you.

00:03:48.645 --> 00:03:51.397
Appreciate it.
Bye, thank you.

00:03:58.279 --> 00:03:59.822
Exactly how large

00:03:59.822 --> 00:04:02.325
Istanbul's hair clinic industry is

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:04.619
is impossible to pin down,

00:04:04.619 --> 00:04:08.414
Although the Turkish Ministry of Health sets 
standards for industry, 

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:11.459
which are in-line with EU regulations,

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:18.883
clinics are not required to say how man procedures take place
and medical associations are voluntary.

00:04:18.883 --> 00:04:22.971
So I think it's difficult because there aren't any official numbers.

00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:30.603
There are clinics that perhaps have multiple websites, perhaps named differently, but actually are just one organization. 

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:37.485
Dr. Greg Williams is a practitioner and president of the British Association of Hair Restoration Surgery

00:04:37.485 --> 00:04:40.446
People see hair transplant
surgery as a commodity

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:43.283
that they can shop around
for the cheapest price.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:45.868
But I think the issue is
that hair transplant surgery

00:04:45.868 --> 00:04:50.498
can be, shall I say,
bought so much cheaper

00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:53.084
in some of the health tourism destinations

00:04:53.084 --> 00:04:56.337
that are marketed to the male public.

00:04:57.338 --> 00:05:00.842
I think my colleagues in
Turkey have a better feel,

00:05:00.842 --> 00:05:02.385
and I hear from them.

00:05:02.385 --> 00:05:03.928
But even they, I don't think,

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:06.347
have a full grasp on the magnitude

00:05:06.347 --> 00:05:09.517
of the hair transplant
surgery industry in Turkey.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.189
If getting exact numbers is hard,

00:05:15.189 --> 00:05:17.317
finding clinics is easy.

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:21.029
You only need to type Istanbul
hair treatment into Instagram

00:05:21.029 --> 00:05:22.655
and you're down the rabbit hole.

00:05:22.655 --> 00:05:24.741
I think it's fair to say
that there are some clinics

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:26.117
that are spending thousands,

00:05:26.117 --> 00:05:27.535
if not hundreds of thousands of pounds

00:05:27.535 --> 00:05:29.620
on their social media marketing.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.749
And the problem is that
young guys who have hair loss

00:05:32.749 --> 00:05:36.461
are just quite often so
devastated, and so desperate,

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:38.963
and just need it, and I get that so often.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.593
Once you click on any form of advert,

00:05:43.593 --> 00:05:46.387
or any form of product,
or any form of service,

00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:50.391
they are cleverly kind
of heavily weighted,

00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.976
the adverts that come through.

00:05:51.976 --> 00:05:54.479
And that kind of resonates
with that hair loss sufferer.

00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:58.066
And is there as a constant reminder

00:05:58.066 --> 00:06:00.026
that there are solutions out there,

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:02.612
and that you need to take
a step forward with this.

00:06:04.572 --> 00:06:05.990
The pressure of social media

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.743
is something Spencer Stevenson knows well.

00:06:08.743 --> 00:06:12.580
He hosts a podcast
called The Bald Truth UK,

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.958
and speaks with men who've
jumped on a plane to get surgery

00:06:15.958 --> 00:06:17.627
and then regretted it.

00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:21.339
Sadly, there are a number of clinics

00:06:21.339 --> 00:06:24.050
that don't necessarily perform surgery

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.344
in the best interest of the patient.

00:06:26.344 --> 00:06:31.307
I see here, in the UK, a high
number of repair patients.

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:33.101
I was a repair patient.

00:06:33.101 --> 00:06:35.061
All this is hair transplanted hair.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:39.315
This has come from the back and moved to the front.

00:06:39.315 --> 00:06:42.902
Spencer's had 13 hair
transplant operations,

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:45.696
many to repair the poor work
done when he was younger.

00:06:46.489 --> 00:06:49.742
The first procedure that I
had done was relatively small,

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.578
but it was done with a strip,
via the strip procedure.

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:56.416
And it ended up being many a
micro grafts in the hairline.

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:59.168
So it looked like a hair transplant,

00:06:59.168 --> 00:07:01.879
it didn't look like a
natural head of hair.

00:07:01.879 --> 00:07:06.717
Which then meant that I had
to continue to find a way

00:07:06.717 --> 00:07:09.178
to resolve that and make
it much more natural.

00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:12.056
Frighteningly, I see it a great deal

00:07:12.056 --> 00:07:14.350
that people have a knee-jerk reaction.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.645
They see an advert, they
see an affordable price.

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:20.481
And they're so desperate,
and they are so vulnerable,

00:07:20.481 --> 00:07:23.359
that they feel that it's a
solution to all their problems,

00:07:23.359 --> 00:07:25.695
and that it can be fixed very quickly.

00:07:25.695 --> 00:07:28.197
And they are on a flight out of here.

00:07:33.911 --> 00:07:35.705
Choosing the right clinic in Istanbul's

00:07:35.705 --> 00:07:39.667
crowded and social media
savvy market isn't easy.

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.169
There's many clinics which offer surgery

00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:46.174
for less than $2,000, with
little to no medical oversight.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.341
When the doctor will
give us the confirmation

00:07:47.341 --> 00:07:49.719
that everything is fine.

00:07:49.719 --> 00:07:53.014
Hazem Altal runs Blue
Magic's medical teams,

00:07:53.014 --> 00:07:56.142
and he argues only a fraction
of the city's clinics

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:59.687
prioritize medical care over profit.

00:07:59.687 --> 00:08:04.525
350 Clinics, I can tell maybe 10% of them,

00:08:04.525 --> 00:08:06.861
they do this job in medical way.

00:08:06.861 --> 00:08:09.197
They focus on the medical side.

00:08:09.197 --> 00:08:13.659
And the rest, it's a business,
it's a job, it's a work.

00:08:14.744 --> 00:08:18.623
Because there are some
clinics, some clinics,

00:08:18.623 --> 00:08:24.045
they were making daily up
to 50 operation, daily.

00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:28.090
This conveyor belt approach

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.718
relies on one of the most
controversial elements

00:08:30.718 --> 00:08:35.139
of the hair transplant sector,
the use of technicians.

00:08:35.139 --> 00:08:38.100
In Turkey, as in the U.S., and the UK,

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.312
technicians are often used
to assist the procedure.

00:08:41.312 --> 00:08:43.481
But it's the extent of their use,

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:44.941
which makes the difference.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.027
When you cut into the skin,

00:08:48.027 --> 00:08:50.112
I would suggest that's surgery.

00:08:50.112 --> 00:08:54.200
And that should be done by
a doctor who is part of a,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.118
who has a governing body to whom

00:08:56.118 --> 00:08:58.871
they are responsible
to keep their license.

00:08:58.871 --> 00:09:02.375
And in a lot of health
tourism destinations,

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:03.960
that's not what happens.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:08.214
That step is delegated to non-doctors.

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:14.345
Now, a lot of doctors in these clinics

00:09:14.345 --> 00:09:16.430
will justify that by saying, well,

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.808
these non-doctors are
trained, they're technicians.

00:09:18.808 --> 00:09:20.268
They're very good at the job.

00:09:20.268 --> 00:09:21.185
A lot of doctors will say,

00:09:21.185 --> 00:09:24.105
the technicians are better
than they themselves, a doctor.

00:09:24.105 --> 00:09:25.773
That does not make it right.

00:09:25.773 --> 00:09:27.608
That does not make it ethical.

00:09:27.608 --> 00:09:29.986
And in some countries that
does not make it legal.

00:09:33.698 --> 00:09:34.782
The technician model

00:09:34.782 --> 00:09:36.659
is one of the biggest factors in helping

00:09:36.659 --> 00:09:39.453
to drive down the price of surgery.

00:09:39.453 --> 00:09:42.498
A doctor oversees the
work, a technician does it.

00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:45.543
If you are requiring this,

00:09:45.543 --> 00:09:48.379
like you want the doctor
to do it from A to Z,

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:50.172
this will cost you a lot of money

00:09:50.172 --> 00:09:52.883
because you are requesting
a private doctor

00:09:52.883 --> 00:09:54.760
to be from A to Z with you.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.888
So the cost, of course,
will be too much high.

00:09:57.888 --> 00:10:00.808
So that's why technicians are needed.

00:10:00.808 --> 00:10:02.351
Technicians, these days,

00:10:02.351 --> 00:10:04.312
with the experience they are having,

00:10:04.312 --> 00:10:06.480
they are reaching an amazing,

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.482
they are doing an amazing work actually.

00:10:10.985 --> 00:10:15.990
Operating room is ready
for tomorrow's patient.

00:10:16.657 --> 00:10:19.952
Dr. Kayihan Sahinoglu
is one of three fellows

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.579
of the International Society

00:10:21.579 --> 00:10:24.582
of Hair Restoration Surgery in Istanbul.

00:10:24.582 --> 00:10:27.877
He, like everyone else, uses technicians.

00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:31.464
But does the incisions and extractions himself.

00:10:31.672 --> 00:10:34.800
It is a competition between

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:42.683
this kind of technician clinics
and these kind of companies.

00:10:42.683 --> 00:10:45.102
Yeah, they may compete.

00:10:45.102 --> 00:10:48.689
I don't think there is a big
competition between doctors.

00:10:48.689 --> 00:10:51.275
There's a competition
between technician clinics.

00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:54.612
Dr. Sahinoglu,

00:10:54.612 --> 00:10:56.697
like the other clinics we've spoken to,

00:10:56.697 --> 00:10:59.617
believes it's time the
sector was regulated,

00:10:59.617 --> 00:11:01.369
but he's got concerns.

00:11:01.702 --> 00:11:07.667
When you put big
restrictions and regulations,

00:11:07.667 --> 00:11:13.589
they, I mean, the sector
will go a illegal way.

00:11:13.589 --> 00:11:16.384
So it is not easy to regulate,

00:11:16.384 --> 00:11:21.222
but it has to be regulated
because it's about life.

00:11:21.222 --> 00:11:24.684
I mean, you are doing
a procedure on human.

00:11:25.393 --> 00:11:27.061
The most at-risk group

00:11:27.061 --> 00:11:30.231
are young men who rush
to get the operation done

00:11:30.231 --> 00:11:33.609
by clinics who are only too
happy to take their business.

00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:36.612
And when they have their
transplant, quite often

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:39.782
it will be done to a design
that they've requested,

00:11:39.782 --> 00:11:43.786
which is low, youthful,
rounded, squared off temples.

00:11:43.786 --> 00:11:45.663
And it may look good
for a couple of years.

00:11:45.663 --> 00:11:48.791
But when they reach 30, 40, 50, 60,

00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:50.501
and they've lost a lot more hair,

00:11:50.501 --> 00:11:52.378
that's going to be their
permanent hairline,

00:11:52.378 --> 00:11:54.171
because those hairs don't deteriorate.

00:11:54.171 --> 00:11:55.172
When they're taken from the sides

00:11:55.172 --> 00:11:56.882
and the back of the
head, and transplanted,

00:11:56.882 --> 00:11:58.175
they're there for the duration.

00:11:58.175 --> 00:12:00.594
Now, what I do think is
gonna happen in five,

00:12:00.594 --> 00:12:03.764
10, 15, 20 years time, is
I think we're gonna see

00:12:03.764 --> 00:12:07.518
an absolute epidemic of men who had

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:10.104
aggressive hairlines transplanted
when they were young.

00:12:10.104 --> 00:12:12.648
By aggressive, I mean
low and quite rounded.

00:12:12.648 --> 00:12:15.192
And then go on to lose
significant amounts of hairs,

00:12:15.192 --> 00:12:16.986
so start to look like
their balding fathers

00:12:16.986 --> 00:12:20.072
and grandfathers, which is
what they wanted to avoid

00:12:20.072 --> 00:12:21.615
happening by having a transplant,

00:12:21.615 --> 00:12:23.284
without realizing that the transplant's

00:12:23.284 --> 00:12:24.952
not gonna stop that happening.

00:12:24.952 --> 00:12:27.204
From a man point of view,

00:12:27.204 --> 00:12:28.330
when you start to lose your hair,

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.040
you are very isolated.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:35.045
And it is very easy to become
very consumed by hair loss,

00:12:35.045 --> 00:12:37.757
and seeking a resolve for that.

00:12:37.757 --> 00:12:39.800
And because of the nature of the internet,

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.969
and the nature of social media,

00:12:41.969 --> 00:12:45.222
the information is aplenty out there.

00:12:45.222 --> 00:12:48.058
But the accurate
information isn't aplenty.

00:12:48.058 --> 00:12:49.935
And we need to make sure that people

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:53.105
find those resources to get
the right decisions made.

00:12:53.439 --> 00:12:58.068
The messages are, do your
homework, do your research.

00:12:58.068 --> 00:13:01.655
Just don't make rash decisions.

00:13:01.655 --> 00:13:06.243
And if you are a proper
candidate for hair transplant,

00:13:06.243 --> 00:13:09.830
I recommend hair transplant to everyone.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.375
But everybody who look for
a solution for hair loss

00:13:13.375 --> 00:13:16.545
has to do their homework very well.

00:13:16.545 --> 00:13:19.673
And they have to find the right doctor

00:13:19.673 --> 00:13:22.176
and right place, everywhere.

00:13:32.603 --> 00:13:39.568
On the next episode of Business of Beauty…
China’s aesthetic medicine industry is booming, 

00:13:39.568 --> 00:13:43.113
And the country’s youth is driving the trend. 

00:13:43.113 --> 00:13:49.620
The arrival of dedicated cosmetic apps have made booking surgery as simple as ordering a take out.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:57.628
Now the market in China is now worth over $30 billion, making up for 17% of the global industry.

00:13:57.628 --> 00:14:04.802
But the days of paying for perfection might be numbered, as the Chinese government looks to crack down 

00:14:04.802 --> 00:14:08.055
on an industry that they claim is distorting aesthetic perceptions.

